      "id": "claim_a6ec133728894f9490b6fcfd761683c7",
      "statement": "Version derivation uses the latest GitHub release tag (v-stripped) with the build number approximated as the release count; no argument bumps minor by 0.1 with carry, one argument sets the marketing version, and two set both; a duplicate computed tag aborts with error and an interactive y/N confirm follows before any changes.",
