    {
      "id": "claim_19ca9d8f2c2c43f1ad8c9c416f910e1c",
      "statement": "release.sh has no auto-update or appcast step: it auto-bumps the version from the latest GitHub Release, archives and exports with a developer-id ExportOptions plist (signing and notarizing the app), builds a DMG with create-dmg, notarizes and staples the DMG with notarytool and stapler, and publishes it with gh release create --latest.",
